{
 "voice": "kokoro/am_michael",
 "duration": 61.652,
 "speech_end": 60.052,
 "chunks": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "mood": "hook",
   "text": "A king put soldiers around his own field... and secretly ordered them to let the thieves in.",
   "s": 0.25,
   "e": 5.541
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "mood": "normal",
   "text": "You see, his kingdom was starving. And he had the perfect food. Potatoes. They grew almost anywhere.",
   "s": 5.941,
   "e": 11.495
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "mood": "normal",
   "text": "But nobody would eat them. Ugly. Dirty. Food for pigs.",
   "s": 11.715,
   "e": 15.039
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "mood": "normal",
   "text": "He ordered them to eat potatoes. They refused. He gave them away for free. They fed them to the pigs.",
   "s": 15.259,
   "e": 21.088
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "mood": "turn",
   "text": "So with winter coming, the king tried something strange.",
   "s": 21.488,
   "e": 24.499
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "mood": "normal",
   "text": "He planted potatoes right next to the palace, and put soldiers around the field. Day and night.",
   "s": 24.719,
   "e": 29.827
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "mood": "normal",
   "text": "And the farmers started whispering. If the king guards it like gold... maybe it is gold.",
   "s": 30.047,
   "e": 35.19
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "mood": "dread",
   "text": "One night, a farmer crept past the guards. They didn't move. He came back with a sack. Then his neighbor came. Then the whole village.",
   "s": 35.59,
   "e": 43.386
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "mood": "turn",
   "text": "The soldiers saw everything. Their orders were simple. Look the other way.",
   "s": 43.606,
   "e": 47.759
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "mood": "normal",
   "text": "By spring, potatoes were growing in secret gardens all over the kingdom. And by winter, nobody was starving.",
   "s": 48.159,
   "e": 54.783
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "mood": "final",
   "text": "Because the fastest way to make people want something... is to tell them they can't have it.",
   "s": 55.003,
   "e": 60.052
  }
 ],
